{"unit_id":"0neKbyte__dsh-approval-assistant_0neKbyte#card-zh","repo":"0neKbyte/dsh-approval-assistant_0neKbyte","commit":"583136e122d886b5c28110d0f190793bbfd6e5ac","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Approval Assistant 是面向 DSH 网页端的审批与提醒插件：它在宿主侧监听审批请求和工具事件，并在网页侧提供设置页面与右上角提醒弹窗。它可以提醒待处理的审批、通知审批通过或拒绝的结果、提示模型提出的问题，也能在工具执行结束时提醒；用户还可启用全部自动审批，或按工具名称关键词匹配后自动通过。提醒可以分别使用弹窗、浏览器系统通知和声音，并可设置自定义音频。适合希望及时看到审批和提问、或配置自动审批流程的 DSH 网页端用户。插件依赖 webServer 服务，系统通知需要浏览器授权。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:152-225","client.js:121-167","client.js:236-290"]}
{"unit_id":"0neKbyte__dsh-approval-assistant_0neKbyte#card-en","repo":"0neKbyte/dsh-approval-assistant_0neKbyte","commit":"583136e122d886b5c28110d0f190793bbfd6e5ac","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Approval Assistant alerts DSH web users about approval requests and model questions. It can auto-approve all requests or match tool names, then report decisions and completed tools through popups, browser notifications, or sound. Requires webServer; notifications need browser permission.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:152-225","client.js:121-167","client.js:236-290"]}
